Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.86,0:24:36.47,DCMain,AYUMI,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\an8\fs70\fnAsmaa Font\bord10\blur10\3c&HD9A100&\b1\pos(301.333,28.667)}!شكرًا لك
